e, they sneer at those who have been given knowledge, saying, ‘What was that he just said?’ These are the ones whose hearts God has sealed, those who follow their own desires.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"And among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(are some) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَسْتَمِعُ","en_gloss":"listen","transliteration":"yastamiʿu","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"خَرَجُوا۟","en_gloss":"they depart","transliteration":"kharajū","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عِندِكَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"ʿindika","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُوتُوا۟","en_gloss":"were given","transliteration":"ūtū","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمَ","en_gloss":"the knowledge","transliteration":"l-ʿil'ma","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَاذَا","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mādhā","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"(has) he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ءَانِفًا ۚ","en_gloss":"just now","transliteration":"ānifan","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those ","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) the ones","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"47:16"},{"pos":19,"ar":"طَبَعَ","en_gloss":"Allah has set a seal","transliteration":"ṭabaʿa","