rived, what use will it be then to take heed?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَهَلْ","en_gloss":"Then do","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنظُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they wait","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","en_gloss":"(for) the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَأْتِيَهُم","en_gloss":"it should come to them","transliteration":"tatiyahum","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَغْتَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"suddenly","transliteration":"baghtatan","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"But indeed","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"have come","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَشْرَاطُهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"its indications","transliteration":"ashrāṭuhā","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَأَنَّىٰ","en_gloss":"Then how","transliteration":"fa-annā","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"جَآءَتْهُمْ","en_gloss":"has come to them","transliteration":"jāathum","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذِكْرَىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"their reminder","transliteration":"dhik'rāhum","verse_key":"47:18"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"47:18"}]},{"verse_key":"47:19","surah":47,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"فَٱعْلَمْ أَنَّهُۥ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا ٱللَّهُ وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ لِذَنۢبِكَ وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ مُتَقَلَّبَكُمْ وَمَثْوَىٰكُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [Prophet], bear in mind that there is no god but God, and ask forgiveness for your sins and for the sins of believing men and women. God knows whenever any of you move, and whenever any of you stay still.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱعْلَمْ","en_gloss":"So know","transliteration":"fa-iʿ'lam","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"that [He] ","transliteration":"annahu","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"and ask forgiveness","transliteration":"wa-is'taghfir","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِذَنۢبِكَ","en_gloss":"for your sin","transliteration":"lidhanbika","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"and for the believing men","transliteration":"walil'mu'minīna","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ۗ","en_gloss":"and the believing women","transliteration":"wal-mu'mināti","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مُتَقَلَّبَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your movement","transliteration":"mutaqallabakum","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمَثْوَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"and your resting places","transliteration":"wamathwākum","verse_key":"47:19"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"47:19"}]}]}